; Surface combinations: a named, world-wide mix per surface. Painting one
; (the editor's Combinations brush) makes a square REFERENCE it, so editing
; an entry here repaints every square that uses it (docs/editor-updates-plan.md).
;
; Fields:
;   display   the name the palette shows.
;   floor     the floors.cat ids its open squares vary between.
;   wall      the walls.cat ids its wall blocks vary between.
;   ceiling   the ceilings.cat ids its ceilings vary between.
;   Each is a space-separated list; an empty or absent one leaves that
;   surface exactly as it is.

[marble_hall]
display = Marble Hall
floor = floor_slabs floor_temple
wall = wall_marble
ceiling = ceiling_stone
